Maintainer: Iceland mainline <dev@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0

Package: iceland-sensors
Architecture: all
Depends: fastrpc-support, systemd (>= 255)
Description: Qualcomm SSC sensors bring-up data and services for OnePlus Pad 4 (iceland)
 Imports the stock-ROM sensor configuration (vendor/odm SEE JSON and the
 persist sensors registry) to /var/lib/iceland-sensors and links the paths
 the ADSP sensors protection domain requests to those copies. Ships the
 adsprpcd sensorsPD service, the udev tags that let iio-sensor-proxy find
 the SSC sensors, and masks the fastrpc root/audio PD daemons.
